# Teamdash

Python CLI + React dashboard for team engineering metrics (GitHub, GitLab, Jira).

## Conventions

- Python 3.10+, `from __future__ import annotations` in every module
- Dataclasses for models (no Pydantic); see `teamdash/models.py`
- Errors/progress to stderr: `[WARN]`, `[ERROR]` prefixes
- API creds from env vars (`JIRA_EMAIL`, `JIRA_API_TOKEN`), never `.env` files
- Dashboard: React 19 + Chart.js, Vite build -> `dashboard/dist/`
- Tests: `pytest` + `unittest.mock` (no real API calls); Playwright for E2E

## New Data Field Checklist

Update: `models.py` -> `types.ts` -> `aggregate.py` (cache) -> `conftest.py` (fixtures) -> rebuild dashboard

